{"id":"en_daddy-is-not-who-you-think","title":"Daddy Is Not Who You Think","titleEn":"Daddy Is Not Who You Think","description":"Ethan, who stands to inherit a business empire and heads Dragon Hall, meets Sarah Sowle while he is deliberately staying away from his own world in the city. Their meeting kindles a strong bond. Five years on, Sarah returns with Evie, the daughter they share. Once Ethan discovers he is a father, he commits himself to setting things right, though the road ahead proves difficult. Threats shadow the three of them, and it is Ethan's steady, understated efforts that carry them through, until at last they reach the calm family existence they have been seeking. Audiences can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/daddy-is-not-who-you-think/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/daddy-is-not-who-you-think/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Medical Drama","The Chosen One"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkr7g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_daddy-is-not-who-you-think_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkr7g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-is-not-who-you-think_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkr7g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-is-not-who-you-think_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkr7g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-is-not-who-you-think_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","lab